{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RTp4RtFyrm9AEH6bBXZE5X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for all planned experiments in the experiment_plan, under the \"best\" tier definition they've provided. Let me identify the planned experiments:\n\n1. **gold-set** (status: planned) - Human-annotated 650 windows, GO/NO-GO gate\n2. **f1-stag-analysis** (status: planned) - F1_stag per-class breakdown\n\nThese are the only two with status \"planned\". Let me also check if there are completed experiments that need gold-set predictions expanded.\n\nActually, re-reading the prompt more carefully: \"对 experiment_plan 中每个 planned 实验展开详细数据\" — this means I should generate detailed predicted data for each planned experiment.\n\n\nNow I'm working through what the \"best\" tier predicts for each experiment. For the gold-set, I need to estimate the kappa coefficient range and accuracy metrics based on the tier definition that validates LF labels as a reasonable stagnation proxy and confirms structural dominance isn't a circular artifact. For f1-stag-analysis, I'll break down the per-class F1 scores under the best-case scenario where all key assumptions hold. Looking at the performance ranges for temporal onset alignment, the best case lands around 80%. Now I'm thinking through what the f1-stag-analysis entails — breaking down F1 scores for the stagnation class across different conditions like confidence levels and trajectory positions. Let me work through the YAML output systematically, picking values toward the high end of each range for the \"best\" tier since that represents the most favorable outcomes. For the gold-set experiment with 650 human-annotated windows, I'm starting with Gold-LF Agreement around 0.84, reasoning that the structural signals like command repetition and file diffs should capture stagnation reasonably well in the best case.\n\nWhen confidence is 2 or higher, the LF consensus becomes particularly strong — I'd expect around 0.93 accuracy on the gold set since the agreement filters out most noise. But at confidence=1, where only a single LF fires, the ambiguity is much higher; the disagreement rates suggest genuine uncertainty, so I'm estimating around 0.68 accuracy there.\n\nFor structural features, I'm seeing roughly 0.89 macro F1 on gold labels. Even though the circular artifact is removed, command repetition and file diff patterns still capture real stagnation behavior — the ~10.5 percentage point drop from the LF-derived performance quantifies how much was just the LFs reinforcing themselves. The probe model performs around 0.81 macro F1 on gold, which makes sense since embeddings do capture semantic signatures of stagnation, but it underperforms the structural approach because it's missing those explicit behavioral signals.\n\nThe LLM-judge struggles more significantly at 0.67 macro F1 on gold labels. Without domain calibration, it's making random judgment errors that don't align systematically with the LF mistakes. For temporal alignment, I'm finding roughly 80% agreement between the gold boundaries and when the LF patterns actually fire — the temporal signals are genuinely there, though human judgment of stagnation onset has inherent fuzziness of about 1-2 steps.\n\nNow I'm thinking through what the f1-stag-analysis experiment would actually measure. The F1 for stagnation is consistently the weaker class since it's minority and harder to detect, so I'd want to break it down across trajectory position, confidence levels, agent types, stagnation subtypes, and whether trajectories resolved. Let me check what's actually marked as planned in the experiment plan before I construct this further.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31229,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31229},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f1bb9e7e-9fcb-45e0-b16a-df0237fe4e41","uuid":"098a0283-c385-407e-81e3-01e39177bf79"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RTp4RtFyrm9AEH6bBXZE5X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Gold set 验证 LF labels 是合理的 stagnation proxy。Structural dominance 在 gold 上\n  依然成立（0.89 macro_f1），证明 in-domain 0.9951 虽有 circular 成分但底层信号真实。\n  Conf≥2 LF labels 接近 gold 质量（accuracy 0.93），conf=1 labels 噪声大但方向正确。\n  Circularity concern 正面化解：0.9951→0.89 的 drop 量化了 circular 成分（~10.5pp），\n  但 0.89 仍大幅领先 probe（0.81）和 LLM-judge（0.67）。论文按原始 headline 投稿，\n  gold set 作为 Section 5 核心 evidence。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # GOLD-SET: 核心 GO/NO-GO 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Agreement (Cohen's κ)\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      两名标注者对 650 个 k=5 窗口独立标注 stagnation/progress，计算 inter-annotator\n      agreement 后合并为 gold labels，与 MV LF labels 计算 Cohen's κ。\n    expected_results:\n      inter_annotator_kappa: 0.81\n      inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.91\n      gold_lf_kappa: 0.84\n      gold_lf_pct_agreement: 0.92\n      gold_n: 650\n      gold_stag_ratio: 0.33\n      gold_prog_ratio: 0.67\n      lf_stag_ratio_in_sample: 0.30\n      disagreement_cases_n: 52\n      lf_stag_gold_prog_n: 28\n      lf_prog_gold_stag_n: 24\n    result_rationale: >\n      κ=0.84 因为 LFs 的设计基础——command repetition、file diff absence、outcome\n      failure——与人类对 \"agent 没有进展\" 的直觉判断高度一致。三个 LFs 中 cmd_rep 和\n      file_diff 捕获了最明显的停滞信号（反复执行相同命令、不产生代码变更），这些是\n      annotator 也能直接观察到的行为模式。52 个 disagreement cases 主要集中在\n      \"agent 在尝试不同方法但都失败\"（LF 判 progress 因为命令多样，人类判 stagnation\n      因为没有实质进展）和 \"agent 重复命令但实际在 debugging\"（LF 判 stagnation，\n      人类判 progress 因为理解了调试意图）。这两类 borderline cases 数量大致对称\n      （28 vs 24），说明 LF 没有系统性偏向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Gold-LF Agreement Confusion Matrix\"\n        content: |\n          |              | Gold=Stag | Gold=Prog |\n          |--------------|-----------|-----------|\n          | LF=Stag      | 190       | 28        |\n          | LF=Prog      | 24        | 408       |\n          κ=0.84, N=650\n      - name: \"Table 6: Agreement by LF Confidence Level\"\n        content: |\n          | LF Conf | N    | Gold-LF Agree% | κ    |\n          |---------|------|----------------|------|\n          | conf=1  | 215  | 0.83           | 0.62 |\n          | conf=2  | 370  | 0.96           | 0.91 |\n          | conf=3  | 65   | 0.98           | 0.96 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: LF confidence vs gold agreement rate，展示单调递增关系\"\n      - \"Confusion heatmap: 2x2 矩阵 with per-cell 典型 trajectory 片段示例\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.84 落在 best tier 范围 [0.72, 0.88] 的上部。Gold-LF agreement 按 confidence\n      分层严格单调递增（0.83→0.96→0.98），验证 confidence-gradient 实验的发现。\n      Conf=1 κ=0.62 表明这些 labels 噪声显著但仍 better than chance，probe 在 conf=1\n      上 23.6% 的 divergence 部分反映了 LF 噪声而非 probe 错误。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Conf≥2 Accuracy\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中 conf≥2 子集上评估 LF label accuracy。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_conf2_n: 435\n      gold_conf2_lf_accuracy: 0.93\n      gold_conf2_precision_stag: 0.90\n      gold_conf2_recall_stag: 0.92\n      gold_conf2_precision_prog: 0.95\n      gold_conf2_recall_prog: 0.94\n      gold_conf2_macro_f1: 0.92\n      gold_conf1_n: 215\n      gold_conf1_lf_accuracy: 0.68\n      gold_conf1_precision_stag: 0.55\n      gold_conf1_recall_stag: 0.71\n      gold_conf1_precision_prog: 0.78\n      gold_conf1_recall_prog: 0.66\n      gold_conf1_macro_f1: 0.64\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf≥2 accuracy 0.93 因为当 2/3 或 3/3 LFs 达成共识时，多数投票已过滤掉单个\n      LF 的 false positive。在已完成实验中 conf≥2 内部一致率 95.1%，但与 gold 对比\n      会降 ~2pp 因为 LFs 共享的 blind spot（如 \"diverse commands but no progress\"\n      模式三个 LF 都漏判）。Conf=1 accuracy 0.68 因为仅一个 LF firing 时信号很弱，\n      且 cmd_rep 在 SWE-Agent 上 12.75% per-LF error rate 在 conf=1 区域被放大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: LF Label Quality by Confidence (Gold-Validated)\"\n        content: |\n          | Confidence | N   | Accuracy | Macro-F1 | Stag Prec | Stag Recall |\n          |------------|-----|----------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n          | conf=1     | 215 | 0.68     | 0.64     | 0.55      | 0.71        |\n          | conf≥2     | 435 | 0.93     | 0.92     | 0.90      | 0.92        |\n          | conf=3     | 65  | 0.98     | 0.97     | 0.97      | 0.98        |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by confidence level，附 95% CI error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Conf≥2 的 0.93 accuracy 落在 best tier [0.88, 0.95] 上部。这验证了 data programming\n      pipeline 的核心假设：多 LF 共识是可靠的 stagnation proxy。Conf=1 的 0.68 落在\n      [0.58, 0.72] 上部，说明 probe 在 conf=1 上的高 disagreement（23.6%）约一半是\n      \"probe 比 LF 更对\"，一半是 \"probe 也错了\"。\n\n  - name: \"Structural Features on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上重新评估 structural GB/RF/LR，量化 circular artifact 的\n      大小并验证 structural dominance 是否在 non-circular 评估下成立。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.85\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_prog: 0.93\n      gold_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.88\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.83\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_prog: 0.93\n      gold_structural_lr_macro_f1: 0.86\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_stag: 0.80\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_prog: 0.92\n      lf_derived_gb_macro_f1: 0.9951\n      circularity_gap_pp: 10.5\n      gold_structural_gb_accuracy: 0.91\n      top3_features_importance:\n        - cmd_repetition_ratio: 0.28\n        - unique_cmd_ratio: 0.19\n        - file_diff_count: 0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      GB 从 0.9951 降到 0.89，~10.5pp drop 量化了 circular artifact。降幅来源：\n      structural features 是 LF inputs 的超集（30 features 包含 cmd_rep 相关的 5+\n      个 features），在 LF-derived labels 上它们几乎完美重建 LF 投票逻辑。但在 gold\n      labels 上，人类标注引入了 LFs 捕获不到的语义维度（如 \"agent 在 debugging 所以\n      重复命令是合理的\"），structural features 无法覆盖这些 cases。然而 0.89 仍然很高\n      因为 stagnation 的核心行为模式（反复执行、不产生变更、不尝试新方法）确实在结构\n      层面有强信号。Top-3 features 与 LF-derived 评估一致说明信号结构稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Structural Features — LF-Derived vs Gold Evaluation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Δ (pp) | Interpretation        |\n          |-------|---------------|---------|--------|-----------------------|\n          | LR    | 0.9874        | 0.86    | -12.7  | ~13pp circular        |\n          | RF    | 0.9951        | 0.88    | -11.5  | ~12pp circular        |\n          | GB    | 0.9951        | 0.89    | -10.5  | ~11pp circular        |\n      - name: \"Table 9: Feature Importance Stability (LF-Derived vs Gold)\"\n        content: |\n          | Feature           | Rank (LF) | Rank (Gold) | Importance (Gold) |\n          |-------------------|-----------|-------------|-------------------|\n          | cmd_rep_ratio     | 1         | 1           | 0.28              |\n          | unique_cmd_ratio  | 2         | 2           | 0.19              |\n          | file_diff_count   | 3         | 3           | 0.15              |\n          | edit_diversity     | 4         | 5           | 0.09              |\n          | cmd_entropy       | 5         | 4           | 0.10              |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: LF-derived vs Gold macro_f1 for LR/RF/GB，visually 量化 circularity gap\"\n      - \"Feature importance comparison: side-by-side bar chart LF vs Gold ranking\"\n    analysis: >\n      GB 0.89 on gold 落在 best tier [0.83, 0.92] 上部。Circularity gap ~10.5pp 证明\n      in-domain 0.9951 确实包含 circular 成分，但 0.89 的 gold performance 证明 structural\n      features 捕获了真实 stagnation 信号。Feature importance ranking 在 LF-derived\n      和 gold 之间高度一致（Spearman ρ≈0.95），说明 circular artifact 主要是幅度膨胀\n      而非方向偏差——structural features 检测的确实是 stagnation，只是在 LF labels 上\n      分数被人为放大了。\n\n  - name: \"Probe on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 GRU probe（Qwen3-Embedding），量化 probe 在 non-circular\n      评估下的真实能力，并与 structural features 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_probe_macro_f1: 0.81\n      gold_probe_f1_stag: 0.74\n      gold_probe_f1_prog: 0.88\n      gold_probe_accuracy: 0.84\n      gold_probe_precision_macro: 0.83\n      gold_probe_recall_macro: 0.80\n      lf_derived_probe_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      probe_circularity_gap_pp: 9.6\n      structural_minus_probe_gold_pp: 8\n      probe_e5_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n      probe_bge_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe 从 0.9055 降到 0.81，~9.6pp drop。Probe 的 circular artifact 略小于\n      structural（9.6 vs 10.5pp）因为 probe 从 embeddings 学习了部分 LF 规则之外的\n      语义信号——error analysis 已证明 probe 的 FP 模式是 \"diverse commands but\n      ineffective\"，这些 cases 中 probe 可能比 LFs 更接近人类判断。但 probe 整体\n      仍低于 structural 8pp 因为：(a) stagnation 的核心信号确实是结构性的（命令重复、\n      无代码变更），embedding 对此无增量；(b) probe 在 borderline cases 上的优势\n      被 embedding domain noise 部分抵消。BGE-m3 和 E5 在 gold 上微弱领先 Qwen3\n      （+2-3pp）与 LF-derived 评估趋势一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Probe vs Structural on Gold Labels\"\n        content: |\n          | Method         | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Circ Gap | Gold Δ vs Struct |\n          |----------------|---------------|---------|----------|-----------------|\n          | Structural GB  | 0.9951        | 0.89    | 10.5pp   | —               |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)  | 0.9055        | 0.81    | 9.6pp    | -8pp            |\n          | Probe (E5)     | 0.9363        | 0.83    | 10.6pp   | -6pp            |\n          | Probe (BGE)    | 0.9413        | 0.84    | 10.1pp   | -5pp            |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: structural vs probe (3 encoders) on gold，突出 structural dominance\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 0.81 on gold 落在 best tier [0.73, 0.84] 上部。Structural-minus-probe\n      gap 在 gold 上为 8pp，落在 [6, 15] 范围内。这证明 structural dominance 不是\n      circular artifact——在公平的 gold 评估下，simple structural features 仍然优于\n      neural embedding probe。Encoder-agnostic 结论在 gold 上维持（3 encoders 都低于\n      structural），进一步支持 \"stagnation signals are structural, not semantic\"。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-Judge on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 Claude Sonnet LLM-as-judge baseline，验证 structural\n      vs LLM-judge gap 在 non-circular 评估下的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.67\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_stag: 0.58\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_prog: 0.76\n      gold_llm_judge_accuracy: 0.70\n      lf_derived_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.6625\n      llm_judge_circularity_gap_pp: -0.8\n      structural_minus_llm_judge_gold_pp: 22\n      probe_minus_llm_judge_gold_pp: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.67，几乎与 LF-derived 评估（0.6625）持平，甚至微弱上升\n      0.8pp。这是因为 LLM-judge 的错误模式与 LF 的错误模式不相关——LLM 的 zero-shot\n      判断基于通用语言理解而非 LF 规则，所以 LF labels 和 gold labels 之间的差异\n      不系统性影响 LLM 分数。LLM 在 gold 上微弱改善因为 gold labels 包含了一些\n      LLM 判断正确但 LF 判错的 cases（\"diverse commands but stuck\" 场景 LLM 有时\n      能识别）。Structural-minus-LLM gap 为 22pp（落在 [15, 30]），证明结构方法的\n      巨大优势在 gold 上依然成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: All Methods on Gold Labels (Summary)\"\n        content: |\n          | Method            | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold F1_stag | Cost/window | Latency |\n          |-------------------|---------------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n          | Structural GB     | 0.89          | 0.85        | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Structural RF     | 0.88          | 0.83        | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Probe (BGE-m3)    | 0.84          | 0.78        | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)     | 0.81          | 0.74        | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | LLM-judge (Sonnet)| 0.67          | 0.58        | $0.006      | ~800ms  |\n          | MV LF labels      | 0.92*         | 0.89*       | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          * MV evaluated as classifier output, not oracle\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Horizontal bar chart: 所有方法在 gold 上的 macro_f1，从高到低排列\"\n      - \"Cost-performance Pareto frontier: x=cost, y=gold_f1\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-judge 0.67 on gold 落在 best tier [0.58, 0.7] 上部。关键发现：LLM-judge\n      是唯一在 gold 上不降反微升的方法（+0.8pp），这验证了 LLM 的错误与 LF 的错误\n      是正交的。但 LLM 仍远低于 structural（-22pp）和 probe（-14pp），且 cost 高\n      6 个数量级。这强化了 Claim 1 的 practical message：即使有无限预算用 LLM，\n      structural approach 仍然更准确。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中识别 stagnation onset boundaries（gold labels 从 progress→stagnation\n      的转换点），与 LF firing onset 对齐，验证 Claim 2 temporal dynamics 的 gold 证据。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_onset_boundaries_n: 85\n      gold_temporal_onset_alignment_pct: 80\n      cmd_rep_onset_alignment_pct: 83\n      file_diff_onset_alignment_pct: 76\n      ob_onset_alignment_pct: 72\n      cmd_rep_gold_mean_lag: -1.6\n      file_diff_gold_mean_lag: -0.9\n      ob_gold_mean_lag: 7.2\n      lf_derived_cmd_rep_mean_lag: -1.87\n      lf_derived_ob_mean_lag: 6.7\n      onset_boundary_tolerance_steps: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      80% onset alignment 因为 LF temporal patterns 反映了真实的 stagnation dynamics：\n      command repetition 确实在 agent 开始陷入困境时最先出现（agent 先重复几次命令\n      才开始其他无效行为），file diff 变化在 stagnation 初期就减少，outcome 信息\n      最晚才确认。Gold onset boundaries 使用 ±2 步容差因为人类标注 \"何时开始停滞\"\n      有固有模糊性。Cmd_rep alignment 最高（83%）因为它的 leading 角色最明确——\n      人类 annotator 也倾向于以 \"agent 开始重复\" 作为 stagnation 开始的标志。\n      OB alignment 最低（72%）因为 OB 依赖 outcome 信息，其 lagging 特性意味着它\n      标记的 stagnation 区域与 gold onset 在时间上有更大偏移。Gold-derived lag 值\n      （cmd_rep -1.6, OB +7.2）与 LF-derived 值（-1.87, +6.7）一致性好，轻微差异\n      来自 gold onset boundary 定义与 MV onset 定义的差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Gold-Validated Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n        content: |\n          | LF                  | LF-Derived Lag | Gold Lag | Alignment% | ±2 step |\n          |---------------------|----------------|----------|------------|---------|\n          | command_repetition  | -1.87          | -1.6     | 83%        | ±2      |\n          | file_diff_delta     | -1.2           | -0.9     | 76%        | ±2      |\n          | outcome_backprop    | +6.7           | +7.2     | 72%        | ±2      |\n          | Overall alignment   |                |          | 80%        |         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline visualization: 3-5 个典型 trajectory 的 gold onset boundary vs LF firing points\"\n      - \"Lag distribution: violin plots comparing LF-derived vs gold-derived lag per LF\"\n    analysis: >\n      80% alignment 落在 best tier [65, 85] 上部。LF-derived 和 gold-derived lag 值\n      高度一致（cmd_rep: -1.87 vs -1.6, OB: +6.7 vs +7.2），验证 Claim 2 temporal\n      dynamics 不是 LF label 的循环产物。特别是 cmd_rep 的 leading 角色和 OB 的\n      lagging 角色在 gold 上完全确认，为 \"LF temporal roles are systematic\" 提供了\n      gold-validated evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Cross-Agent Structural Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      使用 gold set 中的 OH 子集（如有），验证 cross-agent structural transfer 在\n      gold labels 下是否仍然成立。若 gold set 仅含 SWE-Agent，则用 SWE-Agent gold\n      子集训练 structural model 并在 SWE-Agent gold test 上评估。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.85\n      gold_swe_probe_macro_f1: 0.81\n      gold_swe_structural_vs_probe_pp: 8\n      cross_agent_inference: >\n        If GB 0.89 on SWE gold (non-circular) and GB 0.967 on OH LF-labels,\n        then OH gold performance is bounded by [0.83, 0.92] given similar\n        circularity gap. Cross-agent structural dominance is validated.\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gold set 650 窗口主要来自 SWE-Agent（gold set 标注以 SWE-Agent 数据为主因为\n      这是 primary dataset）。Structural GB 在 SWE gold 上 0.89 直接证明了 in-domain\n      structural detection 是真实的。Cross-agent OH 的 gold 验证需要单独的 OH gold\n      annotation（不在本实验 scope 内），但可以通过 circularity gap 推断：如果 SWE\n      上 circular gap 是 ~10.5pp，OH 上类似的 gap 会把 0.967 降到 ~0.87-0.92，仍然\n      远高于 probe full-FT（0.751）。这个推断在论文中作为 bounded estimate 呈现。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Schematic diagram: circularity gap estimation for cross-agent inference\"\n    analysis: >\n      Structural dominance 在 gold 上确认后，cross-agent 0.967 的解读从 \"可能是\n      circular artifact\" 升级为 \"真实信号 + 部分 circular 膨胀\"。即使最保守估计\n      （full circularity gap applied to cross-agent），structural 仍大幅领先 probe。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-Validated Circularity Quantification\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      综合分析：quantify circular evaluation artifact 的具体大小，分解 in-domain\n      0.9951 中有多少来自 circular artifact、多少来自真实信号。\n    expected_results:\n      in_domain_lf_f1: 0.9951\n      gold_f1: 0.89\n      circularity_artifact_pp: 10.5\n      genuine_signal_f1: 0.89\n      genuine_signal_above_majority_baseline_pp: 42\n      genuine_signal_above_probe_pp: 8\n      genuine_signal_above_llm_judge_pp: 22\n      circularity_as_pct_of_total: 10.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      In-domain 0.9951 = 0.89（genuine signal）+ 0.105（circular artifact）。\n      Circular artifact 占总 F1 的 ~10.6%。Genuine signal 0.89 仍然是 strong result\n      因为：(a) 远高于 majority baseline（~0.47 on gold balanced）；(b) 高于 probe\n      和 LLM-judge；(c) 在 non-circular 条件下仍是最佳方法。这个分解直接回应了\n      reviewer concern \"structural features 只是逆向工程 LF 规则\" —— 确实有 10.5pp\n      是 circular，但 89% 的信号是真实的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Circularity Decomposition\"\n        content: |\n          | Component                  | Value  | Interpretation                    |\n          |----------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------|\n          | In-domain LF-derived F1    | 0.9951 | Upper bound (circular + genuine)  |\n          | Gold F1                    | 0.89   | Genuine signal                    |\n          | Circularity artifact       | 10.5pp | Structural ≈ LF inputs component |\n          | Genuine signal vs Probe    | +8pp   | Structural dominance confirmed    |\n          | Genuine signal vs LLM      | +22pp  | Cost-free advantage massive       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 0.9951 分解为 genuine (0.89) + circular (0.105) 两部分\"\n    analysis: >\n      Circularity 量化是论文最关键的方法论贡献之一。10.5pp circular artifact 不可忽略\n      但也不致命——genuine 0.89 证明 structural features 的实际价值。这个分解框架\n      可推广到任何用 weak supervision + 相关 features 的 pipeline。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # F1-STAG-ANALYSIS: 按类分解分析\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"F1_stag Per-Class Breakdown by Confidence\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      将 test set 按 LF confidence 分层，分析 F1_stag 在不同 confidence level 的\n      表现差异，识别 probe 检测 stagnation 的能力在哪些 regime 最强/最弱。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      conf2_f1_stag: 0.8633\n      conf2_n: 1780\n      conf2_stag_n: 473\n      conf3_f1_stag: 0.7273\n      conf3_n: 44\n      conf3_stag_n: 12\n      conf3_note: \"small sample, wide CI\"\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_f1_stag: 0.62\n      full_data_conf1_n: 39408\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf=2 F1_stag（0.863）接近 overall（0.859）因为 test set 97.6% 是 conf≥2。\n      Conf=3 F1_stag 低（0.727）主要因为样本量极小（N=44, 12 stag）导致的方差而非\n      系统性问题——error analysis 已发现 conf=3 上 5/44 errors 但这不具统计意义。\n      Conf=1 F1_stag 估计 ~0.62 基于 confidence-gradient 实验中 23.6% disagreement\n      rate 和 probe 偏向预测 stagnation 的 asymmetry（19.99% probe→stag vs 3.63%\n      probe→prog）。在 conf=1 上 probe 过度预测 stagnation 导致 precision 低但\n      recall 较高。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Trajectory Position\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 trajectory 位置（early/middle/late）分析 F1_stag。\n    expected_results:\n      early_0_33:\n        n: 351\n        stag_n: 62\n        f1_stag: 0.82\n        precision_stag: 0.79\n        recall_stag: 0.85\n      middle_33_66:\n        n: 353\n        stag_n: 105\n        f1_stag: 0.80\n        precision_stag: 0.75\n        recall_stag: 0.86\n      late_66_100:\n        n: 1070\n        stag_n: 318\n        f1_stag: 0.88\n        precision_stag: 0.85\n        recall_stag: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      Late-trajectory F1_stag 最高（0.88）因为 late stagnation 模式最典型——agent 已\n      长时间尝试、开始重复、不再产生新代码变更，signals 最清晰。Middle-trajectory\n      F1_stag 最低（0.80）与 error analysis 一致（middle 10.2% error rate vs endpoints\n      6.5%）——这是 transition zone，agent 可能正从 progress 滑入 stagnation 或反之，\n      信号最模糊。Early-trajectory 中 stagnation 样本少（62/351），检测较容易因为\n      early stagnation 通常是极端情况（agent 从一开始就困在错误方向）。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      将 stagnation windows 按行为模式分为 repetitive-command (cmd_rep fires)、\n      no-file-change (file_diff fires)、outcome-failure-only (only OB fires) 三类，\n      分析各子类型的 F1_stag。\n    expected_results:\n      repetitive_cmd_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 315\n        f1_stag: 0.90\n        description: \"cmd_rep fires, stagnation 通过命令重复体现\"\n      no_file_change_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 98\n        f1_stag: 0.83\n        description: \"file_diff fires 但 cmd_rep 不一定 fire\"\n      outcome_only:\n        n_stag_windows: 72\n        f1_stag: 0.72\n        description: \"仅 OB fires，行为表面上多样\"\n      mixed_signals:\n        n_stag_windows: 0\n        note: \"conf≥2 test set 上 mixed 归入上述类别\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Repetitive-command stagnation 最易检测（F1=0.90）因为 command repetition 是\n      embedding space 中最强的 stagnation 信号——相同或相似的 action embeddings 产生\n      高 intra-window similarity，probe 容易区分。No-file-change stagnation 次之\n      （F1=0.83）因为 file diff 的缺失在 embedding 层面表现为 action 序列中缺少\n      edit/write 类 embedding patterns。Outcome-only stagnation 最难（F1=0.72）因为\n      这些 windows 中 agent 行为表面上多样（不重复命令、可能在做 file changes），\n      仅通过最终 outcome 才能判定为 stagnation——这正是 error analysis 中 FP 的主要\n      来源（\"diverse commands but ineffective\"，probe 高置信错判为 progress）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n        content: |\n          | Subtype               | N    | F1_stag | Precision | Recall | Primary Signal     |\n          |-----------------------|------|---------|-----------|--------|--------------------|\n          | Repetitive commands   | 315  | 0.90    | 0.88      | 0.92   | Embedding similarity|\n          | No file changes       | 98   | 0.83    | 0.80      | 0.86   | Action type absence |\n          | Outcome-only          | 72   | 0.72    | 0.68      | 0.76   | Weak — needs OB     |\n          | Overall               | 485  | 0.86    | 0.83      | 0.89   |                    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: F1_stag/precision/recall per subtype\"\n      - \"Confusion analysis: per-subtype error patterns with example trajectory snippets\"\n    analysis: >\n      Subtype analysis 揭示了 probe 的 capability boundary：对 behavioral-level\n      stagnation（重复命令、无文件变更）检测能力强，对 outcome-level stagnation（行为\n      多样但无效）检测能力弱。这与 Claim 1 \"stagnation signals are structural\" 完美\n      对应——structural signals（cmd_rep, file_diff）能检测前两类，outcome-level 需要\n      更深的理解。这也解释了为什么 structural features 在 gold 上仍领先 probe：\n      structural features 直接捕获前两类信号，probe 通过 embeddings 间接学习同样的\n      信号但损失了精度。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Probe vs Structural Feature Importance Decomposition\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      对比 probe 和 structural model 在 stagnation class 上的错误分布，识别两种\n      方法的互补性和各自的 failure mode。\n    expected_results:\n      probe_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.9928\n      probe_FP_count: 85\n      probe_FN_count: 46\n      structural_FP_count: 3\n      structural_FN_count: 4\n      probe_only_errors: 124\n      structural_only_errors: 7\n      shared_errors: 0\n      probe_errors_on_lf_conflict: 52\n      structural_errors_on_lf_conflict: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structural model 在 LF-derived labels 上几乎无错（7 total errors）因为它直接\n      重建 LF 逻辑。Probe 的 131 errors 几乎都是 structural model 答对的 cases——\n      因为 structural features 包含了 LF 规则的完整信息而 probe 通过 embeddings\n      间接学习。两者 shared errors ≈0 反映了不同的 failure mechanism：structural 的\n      极少错误来自 feature 数值精度边界，probe 的错误来自 embedding 信息的不完整性。\n      但这个比较在 LF-derived labels 上是 circular——在 gold labels 上，structural\n      errors 会增加到 ~70+ cases，两者差距缩小但 structural 仍领先。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: Error Distribution — Probe vs Structural (LF-Derived)\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric              | Probe    | Structural GB | Delta  |\n          |---------------------|----------|---------------|--------|\n          | F1_stag             | 0.8593   | 0.9928        | -13.4pp|\n          | Total errors        | 131      | 7             | —      |\n          | FP (pred stag wrong)| 85       | 3             | —      |\n          | FN (miss stag)      | 46       | 4             | —      |\n          | Errors on LF conflict| 52 (40%)| 2 (29%)       | —      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: probe errors vs structural errors 的 overlap\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 LF-derived eval 上 structural 的压倒性优势（13.4pp gap on F1_stag）是\n      circular artifact。在 gold eval 上（gold-set 实验预测），gap 缩小到 ~11pp\n      （0.85 vs 0.74 F1_stag），但 structural 仍然领先。这个 per-class 分析强化了\n      Claim 1：即使只看更难的 stagnation class，structural features 仍然是最佳选择。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31229,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31229},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f1bb9e7e-9fcb-45e0-b16a-df0237fe4e41","uuid":"7040126d-125f-4c5c-95b6-c747ee8f00bf"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":247303,"duration_api_ms":249022,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Gold set 验证 LF labels 是合理的 stagnation proxy。Structural dominance 在 gold 上\n  依然成立（0.89 macro_f1），证明 in-domain 0.9951 虽有 circular 成分但底层信号真实。\n  Conf≥2 LF labels 接近 gold 质量（accuracy 0.93），conf=1 labels 噪声大但方向正确。\n  Circularity concern 正面化解：0.9951→0.89 的 drop 量化了 circular 成分（~10.5pp），\n  但 0.89 仍大幅领先 probe（0.81）和 LLM-judge（0.67）。论文按原始 headline 投稿，\n  gold set 作为 Section 5 核心 evidence。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # GOLD-SET: 核心 GO/NO-GO 实验\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Agreement (Cohen's κ)\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      两名标注者对 650 个 k=5 窗口独立标注 stagnation/progress，计算 inter-annotator\n      agreement 后合并为 gold labels，与 MV LF labels 计算 Cohen's κ。\n    expected_results:\n      inter_annotator_kappa: 0.81\n      inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.91\n      gold_lf_kappa: 0.84\n      gold_lf_pct_agreement: 0.92\n      gold_n: 650\n      gold_stag_ratio: 0.33\n      gold_prog_ratio: 0.67\n      lf_stag_ratio_in_sample: 0.30\n      disagreement_cases_n: 52\n      lf_stag_gold_prog_n: 28\n      lf_prog_gold_stag_n: 24\n    result_rationale: >\n      κ=0.84 因为 LFs 的设计基础——command repetition、file diff absence、outcome\n      failure——与人类对 \"agent 没有进展\" 的直觉判断高度一致。三个 LFs 中 cmd_rep 和\n      file_diff 捕获了最明显的停滞信号（反复执行相同命令、不产生代码变更），这些是\n      annotator 也能直接观察到的行为模式。52 个 disagreement cases 主要集中在\n      \"agent 在尝试不同方法但都失败\"（LF 判 progress 因为命令多样，人类判 stagnation\n      因为没有实质进展）和 \"agent 重复命令但实际在 debugging\"（LF 判 stagnation，\n      人类判 progress 因为理解了调试意图）。这两类 borderline cases 数量大致对称\n      （28 vs 24），说明 LF 没有系统性偏向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Gold-LF Agreement Confusion Matrix\"\n        content: |\n          |              | Gold=Stag | Gold=Prog |\n          |--------------|-----------|-----------|\n          | LF=Stag      | 190       | 28        |\n          | LF=Prog      | 24        | 408       |\n          κ=0.84, N=650\n      - name: \"Table 6: Agreement by LF Confidence Level\"\n        content: |\n          | LF Conf | N    | Gold-LF Agree% | κ    |\n          |---------|------|----------------|------|\n          | conf=1  | 215  | 0.83           | 0.62 |\n          | conf=2  | 370  | 0.96           | 0.91 |\n          | conf=3  | 65   | 0.98           | 0.96 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: LF confidence vs gold agreement rate，展示单调递增关系\"\n      - \"Confusion heatmap: 2x2 矩阵 with per-cell 典型 trajectory 片段示例\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.84 落在 best tier 范围 [0.72, 0.88] 的上部。Gold-LF agreement 按 confidence\n      分层严格单调递增（0.83→0.96→0.98），验证 confidence-gradient 实验的发现。\n      Conf=1 κ=0.62 表明这些 labels 噪声显著但仍 better than chance，probe 在 conf=1\n      上 23.6% 的 divergence 部分反映了 LF 噪声而非 probe 错误。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Conf≥2 Accuracy\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中 conf≥2 子集上评估 LF label accuracy。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_conf2_n: 435\n      gold_conf2_lf_accuracy: 0.93\n      gold_conf2_precision_stag: 0.90\n      gold_conf2_recall_stag: 0.92\n      gold_conf2_precision_prog: 0.95\n      gold_conf2_recall_prog: 0.94\n      gold_conf2_macro_f1: 0.92\n      gold_conf1_n: 215\n      gold_conf1_lf_accuracy: 0.68\n      gold_conf1_precision_stag: 0.55\n      gold_conf1_recall_stag: 0.71\n      gold_conf1_precision_prog: 0.78\n      gold_conf1_recall_prog: 0.66\n      gold_conf1_macro_f1: 0.64\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf≥2 accuracy 0.93 因为当 2/3 或 3/3 LFs 达成共识时，多数投票已过滤掉单个\n      LF 的 false positive。在已完成实验中 conf≥2 内部一致率 95.1%，但与 gold 对比\n      会降 ~2pp 因为 LFs 共享的 blind spot（如 \"diverse commands but no progress\"\n      模式三个 LF 都漏判）。Conf=1 accuracy 0.68 因为仅一个 LF firing 时信号很弱，\n      且 cmd_rep 在 SWE-Agent 上 12.75% per-LF error rate 在 conf=1 区域被放大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: LF Label Quality by Confidence (Gold-Validated)\"\n        content: |\n          | Confidence | N   | Accuracy | Macro-F1 | Stag Prec | Stag Recall |\n          |------------|-----|----------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n          | conf=1     | 215 | 0.68     | 0.64     | 0.55      | 0.71        |\n          | conf≥2     | 435 | 0.93     | 0.92     | 0.90      | 0.92        |\n          | conf=3     | 65  | 0.98     | 0.97     | 0.97      | 0.98        |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by confidence level，附 95% CI error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Conf≥2 的 0.93 accuracy 落在 best tier [0.88, 0.95] 上部。这验证了 data programming\n      pipeline 的核心假设：多 LF 共识是可靠的 stagnation proxy。Conf=1 的 0.68 落在\n      [0.58, 0.72] 上部，说明 probe 在 conf=1 上的高 disagreement（23.6%）约一半是\n      \"probe 比 LF 更对\"，一半是 \"probe 也错了\"。\n\n  - name: \"Structural Features on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上重新评估 structural GB/RF/LR，量化 circular artifact 的\n      大小并验证 structural dominance 是否在 non-circular 评估下成立。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.85\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_prog: 0.93\n      gold_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.88\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.83\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_prog: 0.93\n      gold_structural_lr_macro_f1: 0.86\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_stag: 0.80\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_prog: 0.92\n      lf_derived_gb_macro_f1: 0.9951\n      circularity_gap_pp: 10.5\n      gold_structural_gb_accuracy: 0.91\n      top3_features_importance:\n        - cmd_repetition_ratio: 0.28\n        - unique_cmd_ratio: 0.19\n        - file_diff_count: 0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      GB 从 0.9951 降到 0.89，~10.5pp drop 量化了 circular artifact。降幅来源：\n      structural features 是 LF inputs 的超集（30 features 包含 cmd_rep 相关的 5+\n      个 features），在 LF-derived labels 上它们几乎完美重建 LF 投票逻辑。但在 gold\n      labels 上，人类标注引入了 LFs 捕获不到的语义维度（如 \"agent 在 debugging 所以\n      重复命令是合理的\"），structural features 无法覆盖这些 cases。然而 0.89 仍然很高\n      因为 stagnation 的核心行为模式（反复执行、不产生变更、不尝试新方法）确实在结构\n      层面有强信号。Top-3 features 与 LF-derived 评估一致说明信号结构稳定。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Structural Features — LF-Derived vs Gold Evaluation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Δ (pp) | Interpretation        |\n          |-------|---------------|---------|--------|-----------------------|\n          | LR    | 0.9874        | 0.86    | -12.7  | ~13pp circular        |\n          | RF    | 0.9951        | 0.88    | -11.5  | ~12pp circular        |\n          | GB    | 0.9951        | 0.89    | -10.5  | ~11pp circular        |\n      - name: \"Table 9: Feature Importance Stability (LF-Derived vs Gold)\"\n        content: |\n          | Feature           | Rank (LF) | Rank (Gold) | Importance (Gold) |\n          |-------------------|-----------|-------------|-------------------|\n          | cmd_rep_ratio     | 1         | 1           | 0.28              |\n          | unique_cmd_ratio  | 2         | 2           | 0.19              |\n          | file_diff_count   | 3         | 3           | 0.15              |\n          | edit_diversity     | 4         | 5           | 0.09              |\n          | cmd_entropy       | 5         | 4           | 0.10              |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: LF-derived vs Gold macro_f1 for LR/RF/GB，visually 量化 circularity gap\"\n      - \"Feature importance comparison: side-by-side bar chart LF vs Gold ranking\"\n    analysis: >\n      GB 0.89 on gold 落在 best tier [0.83, 0.92] 上部。Circularity gap ~10.5pp 证明\n      in-domain 0.9951 确实包含 circular 成分，但 0.89 的 gold performance 证明 structural\n      features 捕获了真实 stagnation 信号。Feature importance ranking 在 LF-derived\n      和 gold 之间高度一致（Spearman ρ≈0.95），说明 circular artifact 主要是幅度膨胀\n      而非方向偏差——structural features 检测的确实是 stagnation，只是在 LF labels 上\n      分数被人为放大了。\n\n  - name: \"Probe on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 GRU probe（Qwen3-Embedding），量化 probe 在 non-circular\n      评估下的真实能力，并与 structural features 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_probe_macro_f1: 0.81\n      gold_probe_f1_stag: 0.74\n      gold_probe_f1_prog: 0.88\n      gold_probe_accuracy: 0.84\n      gold_probe_precision_macro: 0.83\n      gold_probe_recall_macro: 0.80\n      lf_derived_probe_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      probe_circularity_gap_pp: 9.6\n      structural_minus_probe_gold_pp: 8\n      probe_e5_gold_macro_f1: 0.83\n      probe_bge_gold_macro_f1: 0.84\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe 从 0.9055 降到 0.81，~9.6pp drop。Probe 的 circular artifact 略小于\n      structural（9.6 vs 10.5pp）因为 probe 从 embeddings 学习了部分 LF 规则之外的\n      语义信号——error analysis 已证明 probe 的 FP 模式是 \"diverse commands but\n      ineffective\"，这些 cases 中 probe 可能比 LFs 更接近人类判断。但 probe 整体\n      仍低于 structural 8pp 因为：(a) stagnation 的核心信号确实是结构性的（命令重复、\n      无代码变更），embedding 对此无增量；(b) probe 在 borderline cases 上的优势\n      被 embedding domain noise 部分抵消。BGE-m3 和 E5 在 gold 上微弱领先 Qwen3\n      （+2-3pp）与 LF-derived 评估趋势一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Probe vs Structural on Gold Labels\"\n        content: |\n          | Method         | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Circ Gap | Gold Δ vs Struct |\n          |----------------|---------------|---------|----------|-----------------|\n          | Structural GB  | 0.9951        | 0.89    | 10.5pp   | —               |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)  | 0.9055        | 0.81    | 9.6pp    | -8pp            |\n          | Probe (E5)     | 0.9363        | 0.83    | 10.6pp   | -6pp            |\n          | Probe (BGE)    | 0.9413        | 0.84    | 10.1pp   | -5pp            |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: structural vs probe (3 encoders) on gold，突出 structural dominance\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 0.81 on gold 落在 best tier [0.73, 0.84] 上部。Structural-minus-probe\n      gap 在 gold 上为 8pp，落在 [6, 15] 范围内。这证明 structural dominance 不是\n      circular artifact——在公平的 gold 评估下，simple structural features 仍然优于\n      neural embedding probe。Encoder-agnostic 结论在 gold 上维持（3 encoders 都低于\n      structural），进一步支持 \"stagnation signals are structural, not semantic\"。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-Judge on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 Claude Sonnet LLM-as-judge baseline，验证 structural\n      vs LLM-judge gap 在 non-circular 评估下的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.67\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_stag: 0.58\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_prog: 0.76\n      gold_llm_judge_accuracy: 0.70\n      lf_derived_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.6625\n      llm_judge_circularity_gap_pp: -0.8\n      structural_minus_llm_judge_gold_pp: 22\n      probe_minus_llm_judge_gold_pp: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.67，几乎与 LF-derived 评估（0.6625）持平，甚至微弱上升\n      0.8pp。这是因为 LLM-judge 的错误模式与 LF 的错误模式不相关——LLM 的 zero-shot\n      判断基于通用语言理解而非 LF 规则，所以 LF labels 和 gold labels 之间的差异\n      不系统性影响 LLM 分数。LLM 在 gold 上微弱改善因为 gold labels 包含了一些\n      LLM 判断正确但 LF 判错的 cases（\"diverse commands but stuck\" 场景 LLM 有时\n      能识别）。Structural-minus-LLM gap 为 22pp（落在 [15, 30]），证明结构方法的\n      巨大优势在 gold 上依然成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: All Methods on Gold Labels (Summary)\"\n        content: |\n          | Method            | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold F1_stag | Cost/window | Latency |\n          |-------------------|---------------|-------------|-------------|---------|\n          | Structural GB     | 0.89          | 0.85        | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Structural RF     | 0.88          | 0.83        | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Probe (BGE-m3)    | 0.84          | 0.78        | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)     | 0.81          | 0.74        | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | LLM-judge (Sonnet)| 0.67          | 0.58        | $0.006      | ~800ms  |\n          | MV LF labels      | 0.92*         | 0.89*       | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          * MV evaluated as classifier output, not oracle\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Horizontal bar chart: 所有方法在 gold 上的 macro_f1，从高到低排列\"\n      - \"Cost-performance Pareto frontier: x=cost, y=gold_f1\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-judge 0.67 on gold 落在 best tier [0.58, 0.7] 上部。关键发现：LLM-judge\n      是唯一在 gold 上不降反微升的方法（+0.8pp），这验证了 LLM 的错误与 LF 的错误\n      是正交的。但 LLM 仍远低于 structural（-22pp）和 probe（-14pp），且 cost 高\n      6 个数量级。这强化了 Claim 1 的 practical message：即使有无限预算用 LLM，\n      structural approach 仍然更准确。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中识别 stagnation onset boundaries（gold labels 从 progress→stagnation\n      的转换点），与 LF firing onset 对齐，验证 Claim 2 temporal dynamics 的 gold 证据。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_onset_boundaries_n: 85\n      gold_temporal_onset_alignment_pct: 80\n      cmd_rep_onset_alignment_pct: 83\n      file_diff_onset_alignment_pct: 76\n      ob_onset_alignment_pct: 72\n      cmd_rep_gold_mean_lag: -1.6\n      file_diff_gold_mean_lag: -0.9\n      ob_gold_mean_lag: 7.2\n      lf_derived_cmd_rep_mean_lag: -1.87\n      lf_derived_ob_mean_lag: 6.7\n      onset_boundary_tolerance_steps: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      80% onset alignment 因为 LF temporal patterns 反映了真实的 stagnation dynamics：\n      command repetition 确实在 agent 开始陷入困境时最先出现（agent 先重复几次命令\n      才开始其他无效行为），file diff 变化在 stagnation 初期就减少，outcome 信息\n      最晚才确认。Gold onset boundaries 使用 ±2 步容差因为人类标注 \"何时开始停滞\"\n      有固有模糊性。Cmd_rep alignment 最高（83%）因为它的 leading 角色最明确——\n      人类 annotator 也倾向于以 \"agent 开始重复\" 作为 stagnation 开始的标志。\n      OB alignment 最低（72%）因为 OB 依赖 outcome 信息，其 lagging 特性意味着它\n      标记的 stagnation 区域与 gold onset 在时间上有更大偏移。Gold-derived lag 值\n      （cmd_rep -1.6, OB +7.2）与 LF-derived 值（-1.87, +6.7）一致性好，轻微差异\n      来自 gold onset boundary 定义与 MV onset 定义的差异。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Gold-Validated Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n        content: |\n          | LF                  | LF-Derived Lag | Gold Lag | Alignment% | ±2 step |\n          |---------------------|----------------|----------|------------|---------|\n          | command_repetition  | -1.87          | -1.6     | 83%        | ±2      |\n          | file_diff_delta     | -1.2           | -0.9     | 76%        | ±2      |\n          | outcome_backprop    | +6.7           | +7.2     | 72%        | ±2      |\n          | Overall alignment   |                |          | 80%        |         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline visualization: 3-5 个典型 trajectory 的 gold onset boundary vs LF firing points\"\n      - \"Lag distribution: violin plots comparing LF-derived vs gold-derived lag per LF\"\n    analysis: >\n      80% alignment 落在 best tier [65, 85] 上部。LF-derived 和 gold-derived lag 值\n      高度一致（cmd_rep: -1.87 vs -1.6, OB: +6.7 vs +7.2），验证 Claim 2 temporal\n      dynamics 不是 LF label 的循环产物。特别是 cmd_rep 的 leading 角色和 OB 的\n      lagging 角色在 gold 上完全确认，为 \"LF temporal roles are systematic\" 提供了\n      gold-validated evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Cross-Agent Structural Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      使用 gold set 中的 OH 子集（如有），验证 cross-agent structural transfer 在\n      gold labels 下是否仍然成立。若 gold set 仅含 SWE-Agent，则用 SWE-Agent gold\n      子集训练 structural model 并在 SWE-Agent gold test 上评估。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.89\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.85\n      gold_swe_probe_macro_f1: 0.81\n      gold_swe_structural_vs_probe_pp: 8\n      cross_agent_inference: >\n        If GB 0.89 on SWE gold (non-circular) and GB 0.967 on OH LF-labels,\n        then OH gold performance is bounded by [0.83, 0.92] given similar\n        circularity gap. Cross-agent structural dominance is validated.\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gold set 650 窗口主要来自 SWE-Agent（gold set 标注以 SWE-Agent 数据为主因为\n      这是 primary dataset）。Structural GB 在 SWE gold 上 0.89 直接证明了 in-domain\n      structural detection 是真实的。Cross-agent OH 的 gold 验证需要单独的 OH gold\n      annotation（不在本实验 scope 内），但可以通过 circularity gap 推断：如果 SWE\n      上 circular gap 是 ~10.5pp，OH 上类似的 gap 会把 0.967 降到 ~0.87-0.92，仍然\n      远高于 probe full-FT（0.751）。这个推断在论文中作为 bounded estimate 呈现。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Schematic diagram: circularity gap estimation for cross-agent inference\"\n    analysis: >\n      Structural dominance 在 gold 上确认后，cross-agent 0.967 的解读从 \"可能是\n      circular artifact\" 升级为 \"真实信号 + 部分 circular 膨胀\"。即使最保守估计\n      （full circularity gap applied to cross-agent），structural 仍大幅领先 probe。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-Validated Circularity Quantification\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      综合分析：quantify circular evaluation artifact 的具体大小，分解 in-domain\n      0.9951 中有多少来自 circular artifact、多少来自真实信号。\n    expected_results:\n      in_domain_lf_f1: 0.9951\n      gold_f1: 0.89\n      circularity_artifact_pp: 10.5\n      genuine_signal_f1: 0.89\n      genuine_signal_above_majority_baseline_pp: 42\n      genuine_signal_above_probe_pp: 8\n      genuine_signal_above_llm_judge_pp: 22\n      circularity_as_pct_of_total: 10.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      In-domain 0.9951 = 0.89（genuine signal）+ 0.105（circular artifact）。\n      Circular artifact 占总 F1 的 ~10.6%。Genuine signal 0.89 仍然是 strong result\n      因为：(a) 远高于 majority baseline（~0.47 on gold balanced）；(b) 高于 probe\n      和 LLM-judge；(c) 在 non-circular 条件下仍是最佳方法。这个分解直接回应了\n      reviewer concern \"structural features 只是逆向工程 LF 规则\" —— 确实有 10.5pp\n      是 circular，但 89% 的信号是真实的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Circularity Decomposition\"\n        content: |\n          | Component                  | Value  | Interpretation                    |\n          |----------------------------|--------|-----------------------------------|\n          | In-domain LF-derived F1    | 0.9951 | Upper bound (circular + genuine)  |\n          | Gold F1                    | 0.89   | Genuine signal                    |\n          | Circularity artifact       | 10.5pp | Structural ≈ LF inputs component |\n          | Genuine signal vs Probe    | +8pp   | Structural dominance confirmed    |\n          | Genuine signal vs LLM      | +22pp  | Cost-free advantage massive       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 0.9951 分解为 genuine (0.89) + circular (0.105) 两部分\"\n    analysis: >\n      Circularity 量化是论文最关键的方法论贡献之一。10.5pp circular artifact 不可忽略\n      但也不致命——genuine 0.89 证明 structural features 的实际价值。这个分解框架\n      可推广到任何用 weak supervision + 相关 features 的 pipeline。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # F1-STAG-ANALYSIS: 按类分解分析\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"F1_stag Per-Class Breakdown by Confidence\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      将 test set 按 LF confidence 分层，分析 F1_stag 在不同 confidence level 的\n      表现差异，识别 probe 检测 stagnation 的能力在哪些 regime 最强/最弱。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      conf2_f1_stag: 0.8633\n      conf2_n: 1780\n      conf2_stag_n: 473\n      conf3_f1_stag: 0.7273\n      conf3_n: 44\n      conf3_stag_n: 12\n      conf3_note: \"small sample, wide CI\"\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_f1_stag: 0.62\n      full_data_conf1_n: 39408\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf=2 F1_stag（0.863）接近 overall（0.859）因为 test set 97.6% 是 conf≥2。\n      Conf=3 F1_stag 低（0.727）主要因为样本量极小（N=44, 12 stag）导致的方差而非\n      系统性问题——error analysis 已发现 conf=3 上 5/44 errors 但这不具统计意义。\n      Conf=1 F1_stag 估计 ~0.62 基于 confidence-gradient 实验中 23.6% disagreement\n      rate 和 probe 偏向预测 stagnation 的 asymmetry（19.99% probe→stag vs 3.63%\n      probe→prog）。在 conf=1 上 probe 过度预测 stagnation 导致 precision 低但\n      recall 较高。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Trajectory Position\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      按 trajectory 位置（early/middle/late）分析 F1_stag。\n    expected_results:\n      early_0_33:\n        n: 351\n        stag_n: 62\n        f1_stag: 0.82\n        precision_stag: 0.79\n        recall_stag: 0.85\n      middle_33_66:\n        n: 353\n        stag_n: 105\n        f1_stag: 0.80\n        precision_stag: 0.75\n        recall_stag: 0.86\n      late_66_100:\n        n: 1070\n        stag_n: 318\n        f1_stag: 0.88\n        precision_stag: 0.85\n        recall_stag: 0.91\n    result_rationale: >\n      Late-trajectory F1_stag 最高（0.88）因为 late stagnation 模式最典型——agent 已\n      长时间尝试、开始重复、不再产生新代码变更，signals 最清晰。Middle-trajectory\n      F1_stag 最低（0.80）与 error analysis 一致（middle 10.2% error rate vs endpoints\n      6.5%）——这是 transition zone，agent 可能正从 progress 滑入 stagnation 或反之，\n      信号最模糊。Early-trajectory 中 stagnation 样本少（62/351），检测较容易因为\n      early stagnation 通常是极端情况（agent 从一开始就困在错误方向）。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      将 stagnation windows 按行为模式分为 repetitive-command (cmd_rep fires)、\n      no-file-change (file_diff fires)、outcome-failure-only (only OB fires) 三类，\n      分析各子类型的 F1_stag。\n    expected_results:\n      repetitive_cmd_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 315\n        f1_stag: 0.90\n        description: \"cmd_rep fires, stagnation 通过命令重复体现\"\n      no_file_change_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 98\n        f1_stag: 0.83\n        description: \"file_diff fires 但 cmd_rep 不一定 fire\"\n      outcome_only:\n        n_stag_windows: 72\n        f1_stag: 0.72\n        description: \"仅 OB fires，行为表面上多样\"\n      mixed_signals:\n        n_stag_windows: 0\n        note: \"conf≥2 test set 上 mixed 归入上述类别\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Repetitive-command stagnation 最易检测（F1=0.90）因为 command repetition 是\n      embedding space 中最强的 stagnation 信号——相同或相似的 action embeddings 产生\n      高 intra-window similarity，probe 容易区分。No-file-change stagnation 次之\n      （F1=0.83）因为 file diff 的缺失在 embedding 层面表现为 action 序列中缺少\n      edit/write 类 embedding patterns。Outcome-only stagnation 最难（F1=0.72）因为\n      这些 windows 中 agent 行为表面上多样（不重复命令、可能在做 file changes），\n      仅通过最终 outcome 才能判定为 stagnation——这正是 error analysis 中 FP 的主要\n      来源（\"diverse commands but ineffective\"，probe 高置信错判为 progress）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n        content: |\n          | Subtype               | N    | F1_stag | Precision | Recall | Primary Signal     |\n          |-----------------------|------|---------|-----------|--------|--------------------|\n          | Repetitive commands   | 315  | 0.90    | 0.88      | 0.92   | Embedding similarity|\n          | No file changes       | 98   | 0.83    | 0.80      | 0.86   | Action type absence |\n          | Outcome-only          | 72   | 0.72    | 0.68      | 0.76   | Weak — needs OB     |\n          | Overall               | 485  | 0.86    | 0.83      | 0.89   |                    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: F1_stag/precision/recall per subtype\"\n      - \"Confusion analysis: per-subtype error patterns with example trajectory snippets\"\n    analysis: >\n      Subtype analysis 揭示了 probe 的 capability boundary：对 behavioral-level\n      stagnation（重复命令、无文件变更）检测能力强，对 outcome-level stagnation（行为\n      多样但无效）检测能力弱。这与 Claim 1 \"stagnation signals are structural\" 完美\n      对应——structural signals（cmd_rep, file_diff）能检测前两类，outcome-level 需要\n      更深的理解。这也解释了为什么 structural features 在 gold 上仍领先 probe：\n      structural features 直接捕获前两类信号，probe 通过 embeddings 间接学习同样的\n      信号但损失了精度。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Probe vs Structural Feature Importance Decomposition\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      对比 probe 和 structural model 在 stagnation class 上的错误分布，识别两种\n      方法的互补性和各自的 failure mode。\n    expected_results:\n      probe_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.9928\n      probe_FP_count: 85\n      probe_FN_count: 46\n      structural_FP_count: 3\n      structural_FN_count: 4\n      probe_only_errors: 124\n      structural_only_errors: 7\n      shared_errors: 0\n      probe_errors_on_lf_conflict: 52\n      structural_errors_on_lf_conflict: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structural model 在 LF-derived labels 上几乎无错（7 total errors）因为它直接\n      重建 LF 逻辑。Probe 的 131 errors 几乎都是 structural model 答对的 cases——\n      因为 structural features 包含了 LF 规则的完整信息而 probe 通过 embeddings\n      间接学习。两者 shared errors ≈0 反映了不同的 failure mechanism：structural 的\n      极少错误来自 feature 数值精度边界，probe 的错误来自 embedding 信息的不完整性。\n      但这个比较在 LF-derived labels 上是 circular——在 gold labels 上，structural\n      errors 会增加到 ~70+ cases，两者差距缩小但 structural 仍领先。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: Error Distribution — Probe vs Structural (LF-Derived)\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric              | Probe    | Structural GB | Delta  |\n          |---------------------|----------|---------------|--------|\n          | F1_stag             | 0.8593   | 0.9928        | -13.4pp|\n          | Total errors        | 131      | 7             | —      |\n          | FP (pred stag wrong)| 85       | 3             | —      |\n          | FN (miss stag)      | 46       | 4             | —      |\n          | Errors on LF conflict| 52 (40%)| 2 (29%)       | —      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: probe errors vs structural errors 的 overlap\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 LF-derived eval 上 structural 的压倒性优势（13.4pp gap on F1_stag）是\n      circular artifact。在 gold eval 上（gold-set 实验预测），gap 缩小到 ~11pp\n      （0.85 vs 0.74 F1_stag），但 structural 仍然领先。这个 per-class 分析强化了\n      Claim 1：即使只看更难的 stagnation class，structural features 仍然是最佳选择。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f1bb9e7e-9fcb-45e0-b16a-df0237fe4e41","total_cost_usd":0.5363347500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31229,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12357,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":31229,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference